  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roads Not Taken: Municipality of Ohrid Going Green, Smart, Innovative (OHRID GO)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;SO1: To decrease the carbon footprint from transport by creating the necessary preconditions for greener urban mobility via establishing (an expandable) Smart City Bike System; SO.2: To diversify the local touristic offer by introducing green leisure facilities (Adrenaline park and Pump Track) and smart marketing tools for green alternative tourism (My Ohrid Mobile App); SO.3 To promote social innovations via establishing and running a Smart Ideas Hub.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
